 class="csec" id="about" aria-labelledby="h-about"><div class="csh"><h2 id="h-about"><span class="no">01</span>About</h2><span>Bangalore · B.Tech CSE ’26</span></div><div class="about"><img src="/img/portrait-320.jpg" alt="Syed Mohammad Rizwan, AI engineer in Bengaluru" width="200" height="200" class="ld"/><div><p class="lead">I’m Syed Mohammad Rizwan (Mohammad Rizwan, or just Rizwan), an AI engineer in Bengaluru (Bangalore) and <!-- -->Associate Software Engineer (R&amp;D)<!-- --> at <!-- -->Novulis Consulting<!-- -->.</p><p class="lead2">I build AI agents and the systems around them: state machines, model fallbacks, validation, human confirmation and grounded retrieval, shipped inside full-stack products.</p><p class="lead2">Off the clock I write poetry, watch <a href="/films">films that shape how I work</a>, and build tools for myself. When an open-source app I use is missing something, I fork it and add it, and send it upstream when others need it too.</p><dl class="kv"><div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Bangalore, Karnataka</dd></div><div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Reliable AI agents</dd></div><div><dt>Studied</dt><dd>B.Tech CSE, NBKRIST</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class="csec" id="work" aria-labelledby="h-exp"><div class="csh"><h2 id="h-exp"><span class="no">02</span>Work</h2><span>3<!-- --> roles · <!-- -->2<!-- --> organisations</span></div><ul class="tl"><li class=""><span class="when">Mar 2026 – now</span><div><h3>Novulis Consulting</h3><ol class="roles"><li><div class="rh"><b class="rn">Associate Software Engineer (R&amp;D)</b><span class="rw">Jun 2026 – now</span></div><p>Full-time in Bengaluru: researching emerging technology, building prototypes and proofs of concept, and full-stack product work on Azure (App Service, Functions, Azure OpenAI, DevOps, Blob Storage and Azure SQL) and Power Platform.</p></li><li><div class="rh"><b class="rn">Software Engineering Intern (R&amp;D)</b><span class="rw">Mar – May 2026</span></div><p>Remote, before joining full-time.</p></li></ol></div><span class="tag now">current</span></li><li class="minor"><span class="when">Jun – Sep 2025</span><div><h3>Supraja Technologies</h3><p><b class="rn">Cyber Security Intern (Web Application VAPT)</b> · <!-- -->On-site in Vijayawada: web application vulnerability assessment and penetration testing, completed with a project.</p></div><span class="tag">internship</span></li></ul></section><section class="csec" id="projects" aria-labelledby="h-work"><div class="csh"><h2 id="h-work"><span class="no">03</span>Projects</h2><span>10<!-- --> projects, <!-- -->2025<!-- -->–<!-- -->2026</span></div><ul class="plist" id="cwork"><li><button class="prow" data-id="pack" data-title="PACK" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="drawer-pack">
