    <div class="body"><div class="ph stack"><h3>PACK</h3><small>2026 · Team of two with Mahesh Babu Kona · built the agent game orchestration and dialogue and moved betting off-chain; Mahesh built the MetaMask betting and player mode</small></div><p class="one">Seven AI agents play Werewolf; people watch and bet, or take a seat.</p>
    <ul class="facts"><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.5" y="6" width="4" height="4"/><rect x="10.5" y="6" width="4" height="4"/><path d="M5.5 8h5"/></svg><span>A <mark>LangGraph</mark> <mark>state machine</mark> runs setup → night → morning → discussion → voting, with a win check each round.</span></li><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2L4.5 14M11.5 2L10 14M2.5 5.5h11M2 10.5h11"/></svg><span><mark>7 players</mark> per game (<mark>2 wolves</mark>, 1 seer, 4 villagers) drawn from <mark>12 characters</mark> with personas.</span></li><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="10" height="7.5"/><path d="M5 7V5a3 3 0 016 0v2"/></svg><span>Each agent keeps <mark>private reasoning</mark> separate from its public speech; the UI shows both side by side.</span></li><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.5l5.5 2v4c0 3.5-2.5 6-5.5 7-3-1-5.5-3.5-5.5-7v-4z"/><path d="M5.5 8l2 2 3-3.5"/></svg><span>Model chain: Groq <mark>llama-3.3-70b</mark> → <mark>llama-3.1-8b</mark> → OpenAI <mark>gpt-4o-mini</mark> → <mark>deterministic mock</mark>, so a game never stalls.</span></li><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="10" height="7.5"/><path d="M5 7V5a3 3 0 016 0v2"/></svg><span>The server filters hidden roles out of the bettor view.</span></li><li class="fi"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2L4.5 14M11.5 2L10 14M2.5 5.5h11M2 10.5h11"/></svg><span>At the hackathon bets settled on-chain on Monad; the current build uses play money.</span></li></ul>
