    </div></div></li></ul></section><section class="csec" id="principles" aria-labelledby="h-pr"><div class="csh"><h2 id="h-pr"><span class="no">04</span>How I build</h2><span>6<!-- --> habits, each with receipts</span></div><ol class="pr"><li><span class="pn">01</span><h3>Every model call has a way down</h3><p>A fallback model, then something deterministic. A provider outage should cost quality, never the answer.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/pack">PACK</a><a href="/work/cpl">Campus Premier League</a><a href="/work/ccr">CCR Compliance Advisor</a><a href="/work/finboom">FinBoom</a></div></li><li><span class="pn">02</span><h3>The model proposes, people approve</h3><p>Models extract a validated action; nothing is written or sent until a person confirms. The model gets no database access.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/finboom">FinBoom</a></div></li><li><span class="pn">03</span><h3>Cite it or don’t say it</h3><p>Answers come from retrieved sources with a citation per claim. This site checks every sentence its own agent writes.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/ccr">CCR Compliance Advisor</a></div></li><li><span class="pn">04</span><h3>State lives in code, not the prompt</h3><p>Game phases, orders and auction bids sit in state machines and locked database functions the model can’t skip.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/pack">PACK</a><a href="/work/voice">Ten Days of Voice Agents</a><a href="/work/cpl">Campus Premier League</a></div></li><li><span class="pn">05</span><h3>Crashes resume, they don’t restart</h3><p>Long jobs checkpoint as they go, so a failure picks up where it stopped.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/ccr">CCR Compliance Advisor</a></div></li><li><span class="pn">06</span><h3>Think like the attacker</h3><p>A security internship and a CTF prize behind him: hidden data is filtered server-side and roles are verified, not trusted.</p><div class="proof"><span>seen in</span><a href="/work/pack">PACK</a><a href="/work/ngo">NGO Donor Matcher</a></div></li></ol></section><section class="csec" id="toolkit" aria-labelledby="h-tk"><div class="csh"><h2 id="h-tk"><span class="no">05</span>Toolkit</h2><span>35<!-- --> skills and tools across <!-- -->4<!-- --> areas</span></div><div class="mq big" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track" style="--d:56s"><span><span class="w2">LangGraph</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">FastAPI</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">Next.js</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">Azure</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">Spring Boot</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">TypeScript</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">PostgreSQL</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.4 11.4 6.6 12 0z"/></svg><span class="w2">Python</span><svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 0c.6 6.6 5.4 11.4 12 12-6.6.6-11.4 5.4-12 12-.6-6.6-5.4-11.4-12-12C6.6 11.