.5\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhisper transcribes the learner; a normalised edit-distance score turns it into \u003cmark\u003e0–100\u003c/mark\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"fi\"\u003e\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M8 1.5v4M8 10.5v4M1.5 8h4M10.5 8h4M3.5 3.5l2.5 2.5M10 10l2.5 2.5M12.5 3.5L10 6M6 10l-2.5 2.5\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAn AI tutor and quiz generation run on Groq \u003cmark\u003eLlama 3.3 70B\u003c/mark\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli class=\"fi\"\u003e\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M6 2L4.5 14M11.5 2L10 14M2.5 5.5h11M2 10.5h11\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmark\u003e8 modules\u003c/mark\u003e and \u003cmark\u003e140\u003c/mark\u003e vocabulary entries with native script, transliteration and the Tamil cognate.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"chips\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip\"\u003eExpo\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip\"\u003eReact Native\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip\"\u003eFirebase\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip\"\u003eGroq\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip\"\u003eWhisper\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003cdiv class=\"links\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"btn\" href=\"https://github.com/rizwan2004cs/kerala-immersion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eSource \u003cspan class=\"arr\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca class=\"btn\" href=\"/work/kerala\"\u003eFull write-up\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbutton class=\"btn sl\" data-sl=\"kerala\" aria-pressed=\"false\"\u003e\u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M4 2h8v12l-4-3-4 3z\"/\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eShortlist\u003c/button\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"src\"\u003esource · kerala-immersion: src/services/pronunciation.ts, src/data/vocabData.ts\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/article\u003e\u003cdiv class=